<title>USA: Auto-By-Tel Corp says files for IPO.</title>
<headline>Auto-By-Tel Corp says files for IPO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auto-By-Tel Corp said Friday it has filed for a proposed initial public offering of shares of common stock.</p>
<p>A portion of those shares are to be sold by a selling stockholder, it said.</p>
<p>Auto-By-Tel is an Internet-based marketing service for purchasing new and used vehicles and related consumer services.</p>
